# The website has no database access of its own. Bookings, free slots and
# the service catalog come from WerkPlan's public API (../werkplan,
# app/api/public/v1). See README.md "Verbindung zu WerkPlan".
#
# WERKPLAN_API_URL: base URL of the WerkPlan deployment, without trailing
# slash (local: http://localhost:3000 with WerkPlan's `npm run dev`).
#
# WERKPLAN_API_KEY: the workshop's site key ("wp_live_…"). It identifies
# the workshop, so it doubles as tenant id. Issue/rotate it in the WerkPlan
# repo with `npx tsx scripts/rotate-site-key.ts <workshop-slug>`.
# Server-only — never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_ or use in client components.
WERKPLAN_API_URL="http://localhost:3000"
WERKPLAN_API_KEY=""
